      },
      "body": "I think this isn't the right place to add the check, the `_PyFile_Flush` just before this could result in the same issue, and the cookie's buffer / decoding into it isn't what actually breaks (the `buffer` in this function is locally allocated, the cookie should be valid the whole time of this function).\r\n\r\nI think this should do a `CHECK_ATTACHED` like check just before the `    res = PyObject_CallMethodOneArg(self->buffer, &_Py_ID(seek), posobj);` as that's what is doing the `self->buffer` usage/call/dereference.",
